Finnhub Stock API
https://finnhub.io

Market data is fetched at runtime from the Finnhub REST API and is subject to
Finnhub's API Terms of Service:
https://finnhub.io/terms-of-service

No Finnhub data is redistributed with this plugin. Each user supplies their own
API key under Settings -> Credentials, and quotes are requested directly from
finnhub.io by their own PyDeck install.
